{"id":"b45176bca05a0f7a","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-polarsupermodular.md","title":"Boolean polar functions and the join-meet inequality","display":"thm-polarsupermodular — Boolean polar functions and the join-meet inequality","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-polarsupermodular","aliases":["27-thm-polarsupermodular"],"display":"thm-polarsupermodular — Boolean polar functions and the join-meet inequality","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolpolar]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§11.3.2 Definition 11.5 and Theorem 11.3","source_printed_pages":"492","source_pdf_pages":"516","verification_status":"source-statement-and-construction-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-polarsupermodular"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-polarsupermodular</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-polarsupermodular — Boolean polar functions and the join-meet inequality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e9f7b64fb8e6577\" href=\"?note=9e9f7b64fb8e6577\" title=\"27-df-boolpolar\">27-df-boolpolar</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§11.3.2 Definition 11.5 and Theorem 11.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"492"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"516"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-construction-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolPolar}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolPolar}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9e9f7b64fb8e6577\" href=\"?note=9e9f7b64fb8e6577\" title=\"27-df-boolpolar\">27-df-boolpolar</a>。向量关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span> 与逐坐标运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge,\\vee\">\\(\\wedge,\\vee\\)</span> 由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(S,T\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span> 与函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,h:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(g,h:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\le y\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(x_i\\le y_i)\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\le y\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(x_i\\le y_i)\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\wedge y\\coloneqq\\{(i,\\min\\{x_i,y_i\\}):i\\in[n]\\},\\qquad x\\vee y\\coloneqq\\{(i,\\max\\{x_i,y_i\\}):i\\in[n]\\}\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\wedge y\\coloneqq\\{(i,\\min\\{x_i,y_i\\}):i\\in[n]\\},\\qquad x\\vee y\\coloneqq\\{(i,\\max\\{x_i,y_i\\}):i\\in[n]\\}\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolPolar}_n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\vee f(y)\\le f(x\\wedge y)\\vee f(x\\vee y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{BoolPolar}_n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\vee f(y)\\le f(x\\wedge y)\\vee f(x\\vee y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(x\\le y\\Rightarrow f(y)=1)\\},\\quad\nT\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(y\\le x\\Rightarrow f(y)=1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(x\\le y\\Rightarrow f(y)=1)\\},\\quad\nT\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(y\\le x\\Rightarrow f(y)=1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"g(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;x\\in S,\\\\0&amp;x\\notin S,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nh(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;x\\in T,\\\\0&amp;x\\notin T\\end{cases}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[g(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;x\\in S,\\\\0&amp;x\\notin S,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nh(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;x\\in T,\\\\0&amp;x\\notin T\\end{cases}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolPolar}_n\\Rightarrow\n\\left(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=(g(x)\\vee h(x)))\\right)\\land\n\\left(\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(x\\le y\\Rightarrow g(x)\\le g(y)\\land h(x)\\ge h(y))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{BoolPolar}_n\\Rightarrow\n\\left(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=(g(x)\\vee h(x)))\\right)\\land\n\\left(\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(x\\le y\\Rightarrow g(x)\\le g(y)\\land h(x)\\ge h(y))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 11.3，印刷 p.492／PDF p.516。正分量的真点向上保持、负分量向下保持，故分解推出不等式。反向若真点q既不在S也不在T，则存在p≤q≤r且f(p)=f(r)=0；取z在q为0的位复制r，在q为1的位复制p，得到z∧q=p、z∨q=r，违反不等式。这里连接两侧是布尔∨，不是实值超模的加法不等式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolpolar","status":"resolved","id":"9e9f7b64fb8e6577","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolpolar]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolpolar","status":"resolved","id":"9e9f7b64fb8e6577","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$，$\\mathrm{BoolPolar}_n$ 见 [[27-df-boolpolar]]。向量关系 $\\le$ 与逐坐标运算 $\\wedge,\\vee$ 由下式定义。$S,T\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$ 与函数 $g,h:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$ 由下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolPolar}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\le","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge,\\vee","display":false},{"tex":"S,T\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"g,h:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"x\\le y\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(x_i\\le y_i)\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"x\\wedge y\\coloneqq\\{(i,\\min\\{x_i,y_i\\}):i\\in[n]\\},\\qquad x\\vee y\\coloneqq\\{(i,\\max\\{x_i,y_i\\}):i\\in[n]\\}\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolPolar}_n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\vee f(y)\\le f(x\\wedge y)\\vee f(x\\vee y)).","display":true},{"tex":"S\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(x\\le y\\Rightarrow f(y)=1)\\},\\quad\nT\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(y\\le x\\Rightarrow f(y)=1)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"g(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&x\\in S,\\\\0&x\\notin S,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nh(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&x\\in T,\\\\0&x\\notin T\\end{cases}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolPolar}_n\\Rightarrow\n\\left(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=(g(x)\\vee h(x)))\\right)\\land\n\\left(\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(x\\le y\\Rightarrow g(x)\\le g(y)\\land h(x)\\ge h(y))\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2323,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-polarsupermodular|thm-polarsupermodular — Boolean polar functions and the join-meet inequality]]"}],"outgoing":["9e9f7b64fb8e6577"]}